    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of disclosing or using information without permission.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) information is disclosed to the person as permitted by subsection 295V(1) or (2) or 295W(1); and  (b) the person uses or discloses the information; and  (c) the use or disclosure referred to in paragraph (b) of this subsection is not for a purpose connected with persons being alerted to the emergency or likely emergency concerned.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.)";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
